# --- Mirrored rules for reports/ subfolders created by 2026-07-19 reorg ---
# (files below were previously excluded by the reports/*.json|*.csv|*.py|*.glb|*_draft_*.md|*_20260*.md
#  rules above when they lived flat in reports/; moving them one level deeper into topical
#  subfolders would otherwise silently un-ignore them, so the same exclusion is mirrored here.)
reports/manuscript_archive/*_20260*.md
reports/manuscript_drafts/*.py
reports/manuscript_drafts/*_draft_*.md
reports/manuscript_drafts/*_20260*.md
reports/meetings/*.py
reports/meetings/*_20260*.md
reports/analysis_brain3d/*.json
reports/analysis_brain3d/*.csv
reports/analysis_brain3d/*.glb
reports/analysis_brain3d/*.py
